w the Farm!<\/strong><br>Start small, then expand into multiple massive fields of crops, buildings, and workers.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Agebound<\/i> is an incremental farming idle game where each year unfolds in under a minute.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your field in the spring, looking for bonuses and eventually automate using workers and machines. Harvest the results before winter arrives.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a little field and advance through each age, getting more land and new technology, upgrades, and new ways to automate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your crops carefully to take advantage of adjacency bonuses. Decide what to grow, what to process, and what will sell. Invest your earnings into upgrades that push your output further and make it a lil easier to harvest. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Seasonal Gameplay<\/strong><br>Experience full farming cycles in under a minute: plant, grow, harvest!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/7a61550b9c8d9a2f0fce109637ea9b1b.poster.avif?t=1793660628\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/7a61550b9c8d9a2f0fce109637ea9b1b.webm?t=1793660628\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/7a61550b9c8d9a2f0fce109637ea9b1b.mp4?t=1793660628\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Field Planning<\/strong><br>Use adjacency bonuses to design efficient crop layouts that up those yields.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/5626dfda65ed3b025339c593c355c500.avif?t=1793660628\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras_big\/5626dfda65ed3b025339c593c355c500.webp?t=1793660628 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting Good At Production<\/strong> <br>Turn crops into valuable goods through crafting and processing systems that expand over time.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/492c91c2352ccbcbb7a701bc5c52b593.poster.avif?t=1793660628\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/492c91c2352ccbcbb7a701bc5c52b593.webm?t=1793660628\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/492c91c2352ccbcbb7a701bc5c52b593.mp4?t=1793660628\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation Through Workers<\/strong><br>Hire and manage NPCs to harvest, transport, and produce, and take your farm into a self-sustaining one.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/7a61550b9c8d9a2f0fce109637ea9b1b.poster.avif?t=1793660628\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4512270\/extras\/7a61550b9c8d9a2f0f